<title>USA: TABLE - Litchfield Financial Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Litchfield Financial Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Vt. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended     Six months ended</p>
<p>				  June 30,		  June 30,</p>
<p>			    1997	 1996	  1997	 1996</p>
<p>Revenues:		7,691	6,101	14,098     10,751</p>
<p>Gain on sale of loans</p>
<p>			   2,563	2,474	 4,067	3,354</p>
<p>Provision for loan losses</p>
<p>			     300	  529	   735	  954</p>
<p>Net income	    $1,880     $1,564	$3,025     $2,362</p>
<p>Primary and fully-diluted net</p>
<p> income per share    $0.32	$0.27	 $0.52	$0.41</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p> of shares	 5,917,911  5,708,191   5,861,180   5,698,866</p>
<p>(All numbers in 000's except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Full name of the company is the Litchfield Financial Corp.</p>
